					<img class="article__cover" src="" width="100" height="100" alt="" />
					<h3 class="article__title">Screen Reader Testing: A Developer's Perspective</h3>
					<time datetime="26/11/2025" class="article__date"><span class="sr-only">Published on</span>&nbsp;Nov 26th, 2025</time>
					<p class="article__summary">
						Learn practical, hands-on strategies and common pitfalls for developers conducting <strong>effective screen reader testing</strong>, ensuring a truly inclusive user experience.
					</p>
