					<time datetime="26/10/2025" class="article__date"><span class="sr-only">Published on</span>&nbsp;Oct 26th, 2025</time>
					<p class="article__summary">
						A step-by-step guide to integrating <strong>Axe into Playwright pipelines</strong>. Discover how to shift accessibility validation left and implement robust, repeatable testing at scale.
					</p>
					<a href="/articles/1" class="article__link">
						Read this article
					</a>
				</article>
				<article class="article">
