					<time datetime="26/09/2025" class="article__date"><span class="sr-only">Published on</span>&nbsp;Set 26th, 2025</time>
					<p class="article__summary">
						Understanding the <strong>EAA's requirements, timelines, and business impact</strong>. Get clarity on compliance strategies and how this legislation affects your product roadmap.
					</p>
					<a href="/articles/1" class="article__link">
						Read this article
